<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρό-βῐος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long-lived</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1361b33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				2.1.5
			</span></i>; of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.13.1
			</span></i> (hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρόβιον, τό, -ἀείζωον τὸ μικρόν</span> prob. cj. in Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.89
			</span></i>): 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.43
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰθίοπες οἱ μ.</span>, of a
			halfmythical, perh. Abyssinian, people, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				1107
			</span></i>; αἱ M., nymphsat Rhodes, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιός</span>) <i>with a long bow</i>, 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβιος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>.</div>
